{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Collapse Of The Midnight Sun&quot;</strong> is a cozy indie game with metroidvania and time loop mechanics that is about one hour long. You'll be exploring an island that used to be a mountain before the city next to it flooded. The human made fusion reaction that lights up the sky as if it was the <i>sun</i>, has started to collapse. You only have a couple of minutes before it does and time resets. During these couple of minutes, you'll explore  the island and\u00a0memorize it's locations like\u00a0<i>the abandoned</i> <i>train station</i> and tools like\u00a0<i>the lantern.</i> Memorizing these will be crucial for solving the puzzles ahead, before the next collapse and the resulting time loop.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3736860?t=1747499757","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3736860?t=1747499757","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736860/6e318a4a7ccbf6b679aeba666811ba2b9e8d25f2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747499757","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736860/6e318a4a7ccbf6b679aeba666811ba2b9e8d25f2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747499757","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Collapse Of The Midnight Sun&quot;</strong> is a cozy indie game with metroidvania and time loop mechanics that is about one hour long. You'll be exploring an island that used to be a mountain before the city next to it flooded. The human made fusion reaction that lights up the sky as if it was the <i>sun</i>, has started to collapse. You only have a couple of minutes before it does and time resets. During these couple of minutes, you'll explore  the island and\u00a0memorize it's locations like\u00a0<i>the abandoned